=== version
KAIROS_FLAVOR="hadron"
KAIROS_VERSION="v4.5.2-2-gccddab476"
=== kairos-agent upgrade --help (command names in help)
13:To retrieve all the available versions, use "kairos upgrade list-releases". Use the --registry flag to specify a custom registry to retrieve the versions from, otherwise it will default to quay.io/kairos.
15:$ kairos upgrade list-releases
=== kairos-agent install --help (command names in help)
4:It will print out a QR code which can be used with "kairos register" to send over a configuration and bootstraping a kairos node.
=== kairos-agent recovery --help (command names in help)
2:Starts kairos recovery mode.
4:In recovery mode a QR code will be printed out on the screen which should be used in conjunction with "kairos bridge". Pass by the QR code as snapshot
5:to the bridge to connect over the machine which runs the "kairos recovery" command.
12:  kairos agent recovery [flags]
